  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: Dairy Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall objective is to support and strengthen the emerging commercially orientated dairy sector, both production and processing, by provision of relevant expertise, services, and inputs in a well-organised and structural method.This project will be a joint development by six Dutch business partners, and combines a wide range of aspects necessary to develop the dairy sector in Uganda.By stimulating and supporting the development of the dairy sector, the long-term goal is to penetrate the dairy markets by new entry or increase of current presence, in order to increase the services and products of the cluster members.</narrative>
  </description>
